- safe quoted-field parser and spreadsheet-formula-neutralizing serializer;
- deterministic monetary and proof-gap classification;
- friendly file/type/schema recovery;
- automatic light/dark responsive UI;
- accessible focusable mobile table;
- full result download and first-50-row preview;
- local server health and path-containment checks.

Broken or partial: none in current scope. Deliberately deferred: hosting,
storage, accounts, providers, payments, live timing, TMS integration, and
contract-specific rules.

# 3. Critical Decisions & Reasoning History

**Freshness: High - recently verified in this session.**

Browser-local processing was chosen over an API to keep data private and the
core credential-free. After-the-fact reconciliation was chosen over a live
timer to avoid colliding with existing timer products. Exact headings were
chosen over a mapping UI because mapping violates the one-input gate.
Deterministic arithmetic was chosen over AI because money calculations require
reproducibility. Proof gaps stay visible as review states instead of erasing
calculated value.

